# An OpenAI-compatible endpoint is often used to reach models built by someone else, so
# `openai/accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3` was resolving to company "OpenAI" and that
# name was interpolated into the brand-bias judge prompt. See CORRECTIONS.md finding A.
